---
import BaseLayout from "../../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import MetaPill from "../../../components/ui/MetaPill.astro";
import registry from "../../../data/phase-92-fiscal-policy-public-revenue-sovereign-debt-trade-external-balance-macroeconomic-coordination-registry.json";

const revenue = registry.public_revenue_tax_expenditure_distribution_compliance_dossiers;
const budgets = registry.budget_expenditure_stabilizer_delivery_public_value_ledgers;
const debt = registry.sovereign_debt_fiscal_rule_public_balance_sheet_resilience_registers;
const macro = registry.trade_external_balance_supply_resilience_macroeconomic_coordination_ledgers;
---

<BaseLayout title="Fiscal Policy, Public Revenue, Sovereign Debt, Trade, External Balance And Macroeconomic Coordination | FTFN" description="Thirty-two inactive revenue, budget, debt, trade, external-balance, supply-resilience, and macroeconomic-coordination records.">
  <section class="page-section hero" data-fiscal-revenue-debt-trade-macro-registry><div class="hero__copy"><div class="eyebrow">FTFN / Fiscal And Macroeconomic Systems</div><h1 class="page-title">Revenue capacity is not distributive justice, and aggregate stabilization is not democratic legitimacy.</h1><p class="lede">Phase 92 traces public revenue, incidence, compliance and taxpayer rights; budgets, stabilizers, expenditure delivery and public value; sovereign debt, fiscal rules and public balance sheets; then trade, external balance, supply resilience and democratic macroeconomic coordination.</p><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label="8 inactive revenue dossiers" tone="possibility" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive budget ledgers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive debt registers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive macro ledgers" /><MetaPill label="0 fiscal or macro decisions" tone="review" /></div></div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Public Revenue, Tax Expenditures, Distribution And Compliance</div><h2>Eight revenue dossiers remain closed.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/taxation-revenue-capacity-incidence-distribution-001/">Read the revenue and incidence guide</a></div><div class="grid">{revenue.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.revenue_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="20 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/fiscal-revenue-debt-trade-macro-coordination/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Tax bases, rates, incidence, administration, compliance, enforcement, tax expenditures, distribution, taxpayer rights, review, and receipts remain empty.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Budgets, Expenditure, Stabilizers, Delivery And Public Value</div><h2>Eight budget ledgers contain no allocation or delivery decision.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/budgets-appropriations-expenditure-delivery-public-value-001/">Read the budget and delivery guide</a></div><div class="grid">{budgets.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.budget_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="20 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/fiscal-revenue-debt-trade-macro-coordination/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.budget_expenditure_stabilizer_delivery_public_value_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Forecasts, appropriations, commitments, obligations, disbursements, stabilizers, procurement, delivery, additionality, distribution, and public value remain unassessed.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Sovereign Debt, Fiscal Rules, Public Balance Sheets And Resilience</div><h2>Eight debt registers remain inactive.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/fiscal-rules-public-balance-sheets-contingent-liabilities-001/">Read the public-balance-sheet guide</a></div><div class="source-list">{debt.map((record) => <article class="source-row"><div><h3><a href={'/evidence/fiscal-revenue-debt-trade-macro-coordination/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.sovereign_debt_fiscal_rule_public_balance_sheet_resilience_register_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Instruments, holders, purpose, maturity, currency, service, refinancing, assets, liabilities, guarantees, fiscal rules, stress, restructuring, distribution, and future-user duties remain unassessed.</p></div><MetaPill label={record.debt_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Trade, External Balance, Supply Resilience And Macroeconomic Coordination</div><h2>Eight macro ledgers contain no trade, resilience, or policy-coordination decision.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/external-balance-capital-account-exchange-macro-coordination-001/">Read the macroeconomic-coordination guide</a></div><div class="grid">{macro.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><h3><a href={'/evidence/fiscal-revenue-debt-trade-macro-coordination/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.trade_external_balance_supply_resilience_macroeconomic_coordination_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Trade flows, customs, tariffs, treaties, capital accounts, exchange, supply chains, adjustment, distribution, spillovers, emergency powers, policy coordination, legitimacy, and audit remain inactive.</p><MetaPill label={record.macro_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section briefing-band"><div class="briefing-band__copy"><div class="eyebrow">Public Contract</div><h2>Inspect the empty fiscal and macroeconomic state.</h2><p>The export publishes the complete control surface without treating revenue as justice, authorization as delivery, deficits as sustainability, borrowing as investment, exports as resilient development, or aggregate stabilization as legitimacy—and without assessing, allocating, appropriating, procuring, taxing, enforcing, issuing, restructuring, imposing, coordinating, scoring, ranking, or changing a stage.</p></div><article class="record-card"><a class="inline-link" href="/data/fiscal-policy-public-revenue-sovereign-debt-trade-external-balance-macroeconomic-coordination.json">Fiscal policy, revenue, debt, trade, and macro JSON</a></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
